{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hoodie Survivor:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Auto shooter score attack survival game where your character moves forward continuously and you control the direction of travel by rotating left and right </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are six levels in total with 3 different themes: field, desert and space.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shoot enemies and avoid different types of indestructible hazards</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Score 61 points to unlock the next level</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each level can be played forever to try to beat your high score</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Super Hoodie Bros:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2d platformer with claymation graphics and 2 different styles of play: Run and gun and wall jumping with double jumps and down pound attack</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Fieldmaster","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2883700/84239277bfa0f3a7bc17a9daf67ee38416965374.jpg"},{"name":"Desertmaster","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2883700/e10dc29ead86cb8ec0d6d98ecdee699caca593fe.jpg"},{"name":"Spacemaster","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2883700/a6ded517821efd2d75ba7dda5d00e6418d1380f6.jpg"},{"name":"Meadowmaster","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2883700/505ced359dbc5f65ba59ad0a5872a7860d492b34.jpg"},{"name":"Dunesmaster","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2883700/acbeb39f51577e0c14ec97765cae7e7d2b7f9af9.jpg"},{"name":"Cosmosmaster","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2883700/a70d4df2296651fd111333af783e59e22c57f976.jpg"}],"total":6},"background":"https://store.aka